00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.402 line:0%
-Alright, I feel good.
-Well done.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:51.237 line:0%
Well done.
-Thank you. Appreciate it.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.339 line:0%
Alright, Alexa, stop.
Thank you very much.

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:56.375 line:0%
Here we go. It's your turn.
You're up.

00:02:56.375 --> 00:03:01.146 line:0%
